                        <field name="dc_title">St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 133 : Composite manuscript of Biblical-geographical and Biblical-historical content, including works by theologians Jerome and Isidor of Seville, the Cosmography of Aethicus Ister, and the history of an early pilgrimage to the Holy Land </field>
